 ],
 "note": "Same Vauxhall Sport scheme as Cleland's #5 (05_cleland.json, measured on STR 4718), with 56 on the number board and Berridge on the rear door window. Checked on the Super Touring Register photos of Berridge's car: 4716 (near side-on, right side, mirrored for the number and name sizes: two narrower digits, name about 300 model px wide), 3368 (standing in the paddock, front left three-quarter: same front, Mobil 1 on the rear quarter) and 4714 (in the garage, rear: Mobil 1, Sport band, Philips Car Stereo as on #5), and the Getty photo at Silverstone (6 October, 2201200726, right side). No differences from #5 found apart from number and name. TV caption drawings: only two blurry ones (round 12 Thruxton), consistent with the scheme. Wheels: gold BBS-style cross-spoke with polished lip, from the standing photo STR 3368."
}